//! Explicit, terminal-only LTX-2.5 quant measurement controller (sc-18777).
//!
//! This module is compiled only with `terminal-quant-measurement`; no runtime bundle enables that
//! feature. One invocation creates a new evidence directory, renders one immutable case through the
//! unadmitted measurement seam, writes the generated bytes, transcript and exact model inventory,
//! then seals a receipt over those files. Candidate modes require a sealed bf16 reference from the
//! same code/model/GPU/driver/fixture identity. Partial or failed directories never contain a receipt.

